WEBVTT

00:00:15.473 --> 00:00:18.435
It's really not necessary
for you to do this, you know?

00:00:18.518 --> 00:00:21.730
I don't trust you, so I couldn't
just send you out here alone.

00:00:21.813 --> 00:00:23.231
I chose to be here.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:27.819
Anyway, are you certain
this is even the right place?

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.572
Yeah. It's been 15 years,

00:00:30.655 --> 00:00:33.658
but Gara still hasn't moved his base
out of Grave Valley.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.746
All right. Then let's move.

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:38.955
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:44.127
We'll go when I say it's time, Princess.

00:02:16.678 --> 00:02:19.973
INVASION

00:02:20.765 --> 00:02:25.270
THE CONTENTS OF THIS PROGRAM, SUCH AS
THE SETTINGS, ARE A WORK OF FICTION.

00:02:25.353 --> 00:02:29.732
THEY HAVE NOTHING TO DO WITH REAL
ORGANIZATIONS, PEOPLE, NAMES OR LAWS.

00:02:32.443 --> 00:02:33.403
Come on.

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:36.197
There's no need for you to be so afraid.

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:40.410
I said I would let you go if you tell me
how to break Dark Schneider's seal.

00:02:40.493 --> 00:02:43.538
I'm sure
that information is worth your freedom.

00:02:49.043 --> 00:02:51.212
<i>Ugh. It's embarrassing.</i>

00:02:51.296 --> 00:02:53.298
<i>There's no way</i>
<i>I can tell him how it works.</i>

00:02:53.965 --> 00:02:56.885
Tell me, are you in love with him?

00:02:56.968 --> 00:02:59.345
What are you talking about?

00:03:03.224 --> 00:03:06.603
I'm not in love with him.
Don't get the wrong idea about us!

00:03:08.855 --> 00:03:10.899
He's got a real interesting past.

00:03:10.982 --> 00:03:12.192
Have you heard about it?

00:03:12.275 --> 00:03:13.276
Huh?

00:03:13.359 --> 00:03:16.905
If you're curious, then I'll gladly
tell you about all the women.

00:03:16.988 --> 00:03:18.698
There's so many stories.

00:03:18.781 --> 00:03:19.741
Huh?

00:03:21.242 --> 00:03:24.120
The ninjas haven't attempted
a single attack.

00:03:24.204 --> 00:03:27.373
Is that so?
Maybe this isn't the right place.

00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:29.417
Hmm? Wha…?

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.002
Miss Yoko is in danger!

00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.087
How dare you make jokes
at a time like this!

00:03:33.171 --> 00:03:35.423
Don't let him get to you.
It isn't worth it.

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:37.967
Now, let's keep moving.

00:03:41.012 --> 00:03:43.890
<i>I can't believe how selfish he is.</i>

00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:47.518
<i>Poor Yoko. I feel sorry for her.</i>

00:03:50.438 --> 00:03:52.190
Looks like the finally showed up.

00:03:52.273 --> 00:03:53.942
We have to protect Princess Sheila!

00:03:54.025 --> 00:03:55.735
Stay close to me, Princess.

00:03:55.818 --> 00:03:57.528
I'll be all right. Don't worry.

00:03:57.612 --> 00:03:59.239
I know how to wield a sword.

00:04:01.282 --> 00:04:03.743
Oh, I'm… I'm sorry!

00:04:03.826 --> 00:04:05.119
Oh, brother.

00:04:07.622 --> 00:04:11.292
Strike them down!

00:04:11.376 --> 00:04:13.253
Anthem!

00:04:15.964 --> 00:04:17.423
Magic missiles!

00:04:18.049 --> 00:04:20.385
But you're an outsider.

00:04:20.468 --> 00:04:22.929
How did you know
about this secret passage.

00:04:23.012 --> 00:04:25.181
Could you possibly be--

00:04:25.265 --> 00:04:27.392
Shut your damn mouth.

00:04:27.475 --> 00:04:30.853
I've heard before that Magic Missiles
never miss their target.

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.981
Now I've seen it for myself.

00:04:33.064 --> 00:04:35.692
But it's just one type
of Dark Magic spell.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:40.363
There are plenty of others
in your arsenal, right, legendary wizard?

00:04:40.446 --> 00:04:41.698
Hey, Sheila.

00:04:42.699 --> 00:04:44.242
Y-yes?

00:04:44.325 --> 00:04:47.870
If you don't wanna keep slowing us down,
get rid of your sword.

00:04:47.954 --> 00:04:49.831
Your armor too, while you're at it.

00:04:49.914 --> 00:04:51.708
You bastard!

00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:53.584
You can't speak to her like that!

00:04:55.253 --> 00:04:57.380
Am I truly slowing you all down?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.007
Yes, you are.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.008
Uh…

00:05:01.009 --> 00:05:02.844
V-very well, then.

00:05:09.142 --> 00:05:11.644
N-n-now that that's settled,

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.231
let's start looking
for the path to the ninja fortress.

00:05:16.107 --> 00:05:18.651
Yes. Right away, Princess.

00:05:18.735 --> 00:05:20.987
I will follow
and protect you with my life.

00:05:23.281 --> 00:05:26.284
Uh, so Lucien's been
with a bunch of women?

00:05:26.367 --> 00:05:28.286
Is it really that surprising?

00:05:28.369 --> 00:05:29.996
But now you've got me wondering.

00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:32.290
How many girls
do you think he's been with?

00:05:34.584 --> 00:05:37.503
I don't know. Maybe, like ten?

00:05:41.674 --> 00:05:44.344
He's been alive
for close to four centuries.

00:05:44.427 --> 00:05:46.846
The number is more like over 300 or so.

00:05:46.929 --> 00:05:48.973
Four centuries?

00:05:49.766 --> 00:05:51.392
And 300 women?

00:05:51.476 --> 00:05:54.979
Considering how long it's been,
most of them aren't alive anymore.

00:05:55.063 --> 00:05:57.940
However, there is one
I know who's still around.

00:05:58.024 --> 00:05:59.984
With all the time
Dark Schneider had been gone

00:06:00.068 --> 00:06:03.488
you'd think it would've done a number
on a woman's appearance,

00:06:03.571 --> 00:06:06.366
but she's just as hot
as she was back then.

00:06:06.449 --> 00:06:10.828
And that very same woman I speak of used
to be one of Dark Schneider's disciples.

00:06:10.912 --> 00:06:15.416
Plus, she's one of the Four Divine Kings
of the Dark Rebel Army.

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.919
Uh, were the two of them lovers?

00:06:18.002 --> 00:06:19.379
Well, who's to say?

00:06:19.462 --> 00:06:22.006
I'm afraid
I don't know the details myself.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.592
<i> Was Lucien in love with her?</i>

00:06:25.676 --> 00:06:27.512
Anyway, where were we, Miss?

00:06:27.595 --> 00:06:31.057
Hey. My name's Yoko.
I don't want you calling me "Miss."

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.434
Yeah. Whatever you say, Miss.

00:06:33.518 --> 00:06:36.687
You know, if you keep acting as stubborn
as you've been since I brought you here,

00:06:36.771 --> 00:06:40.024
I just might do something
that's gonna embarrass you.

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:45.822
It's slime.

00:06:47.532 --> 00:06:48.491
What the…

00:06:49.492 --> 00:06:51.369
Ew! Ugh!

00:06:51.452 --> 00:06:54.122
The one you see here
happens to be one of my favorites.

00:06:54.205 --> 00:06:55.581
It's a special breed.

00:06:55.665 --> 00:06:59.544
It's especially adept
at melting off clothes.

00:07:01.170 --> 00:07:03.214
Ew, ew, ew, ew, ew!

00:07:05.258 --> 00:07:07.301
Oh no. No!

00:07:08.386 --> 00:07:10.179
Oh, this sucks!

00:07:10.805 --> 00:07:14.142
We've gotten this far,
but how do you suppose we get in?

00:07:14.225 --> 00:07:17.228
Hmm.
Well, looks like they made it easy for us.

00:07:17.311 --> 00:07:19.272
Why don't we just enter
through that big gate?

00:07:19.856 --> 00:07:22.191
Because it's the front gate, Princess.

00:07:25.528 --> 00:07:27.405
Damn. You guys are hilarious!

00:07:28.739 --> 00:07:29.740
Hey!

00:07:29.824 --> 00:07:32.910
Dark Schneider!
Where do you think you're going?

00:07:32.994 --> 00:07:34.996
You're not doing
what I think you're doing!

00:07:35.079 --> 00:07:37.123
Would you look at that.

00:07:37.206 --> 00:07:38.791
It's almost time, boys.

00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:42.462
We'll be able
to see everything any second now.

00:07:43.921 --> 00:07:46.799
Stop. Why are you doing this?

00:07:46.883 --> 00:07:50.136
Dark Schneider, where the hell are you?

00:07:53.097 --> 00:07:54.098
Huh?

00:07:55.558 --> 00:07:56.934
Wait! What are you doing?

00:07:57.018 --> 00:07:58.186
Damned!

00:08:01.272 --> 00:08:02.106
Hmm?

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.570
Hey, look. A way in.

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:10.907
Pretty massive explosion there.

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:12.909
Do you, uh,
think that the ninjas noticed it?

00:08:12.992 --> 00:08:15.495
Of course they noticed it!
How could they not have?

00:08:17.997 --> 00:08:19.916
What in the world is so funny?

00:08:19.999 --> 00:08:22.084
Would you stop laughing and focus?

00:08:22.668 --> 00:08:24.670
Tell me, what just happened?

00:08:25.254 --> 00:08:26.422
Reporting in, sir!

00:08:26.506 --> 00:08:28.883
A group of knights
accompanied by a wizard have…

00:08:28.966 --> 00:08:31.802
Well, they've managed
to force their way through the front gate.

00:08:33.846 --> 00:08:36.182
Did he just say a wizard?

00:08:36.849 --> 00:08:40.394
<i>Breaking straight through</i>
<i>the front gate of a ninja fortress.</i>

00:08:40.478 --> 00:08:42.980
<i>Who would be stupid enough to do that?</i>

00:08:45.483 --> 00:08:46.901
<i>It has to be him.</i>

00:08:47.401 --> 00:08:49.946
Recklessly charging
through the entrance?

00:08:50.029 --> 00:08:51.906
We should go teach them a lesson.

00:08:51.989 --> 00:08:53.533
Yeah. Let's go!

00:08:53.616 --> 00:08:55.910
Hold on a minute. Let's not be hasty.

00:08:56.994 --> 00:08:58.204
It's fine.

00:08:58.287 --> 00:09:01.415
I'm kinda curious to see if they can get
through the labyrinth of death

00:09:01.499 --> 00:09:03.376
on the lower levels of this place.

00:09:03.459 --> 00:09:05.002
It's a good test of strength.

00:09:05.086 --> 00:09:06.837
Isn't that right, Lars?

00:09:16.514 --> 00:09:18.641
You know,
the more I look at her,

00:09:19.225 --> 00:09:21.394
she's actually pretty hot.

00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:25.648
No, no, no, no, no!

00:09:28.609 --> 00:09:31.654
Hmm.
Seems they've cleared the area.

00:09:32.363 --> 00:09:35.950
Strange. Why have they not deployed
more of their forces yet?

00:09:41.539 --> 00:09:44.166
What the hell? It's a minotaur!

00:09:49.672 --> 00:09:50.923
Hey, look!

00:09:51.424 --> 00:09:53.134
There's a ladder over there!

00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:56.095
Look out!

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:02.226
Ow.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:05.229
<i>He… he held me.</i>

00:10:05.313 --> 00:10:07.064
<i>That's twice, now.</i>

00:10:12.695 --> 00:10:14.155
You… you snake!

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:16.782
Keep your filthy hands off of me!

00:10:20.786 --> 00:10:22.913
Hurry! Everyone, run to the ladder!

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.460
Jeez!
No one said there'd be minotaurs!

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.756
Hey!
We're gonna climb the ladder first.

00:10:31.839 --> 00:10:34.091
You guys stay here
and hold that thing off.

00:10:34.175 --> 00:10:35.760
You want us to what?

00:10:35.843 --> 00:10:38.679
Are you trying
to sacrifice us for your own safety?

00:10:38.763 --> 00:10:41.015
Such a cowardly thing to do.

00:10:41.098 --> 00:10:41.932
How dare you!

00:10:43.601 --> 00:10:46.979
Isn't laying your life on the line
for the Princess a knight's duty?

00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:49.231
This is the perfect chance
to show your bravery!

00:10:50.775 --> 00:10:54.028
Do it now! Show some backbone!

00:10:54.612 --> 00:10:55.988
He's exactly right!

00:10:56.072 --> 00:10:58.949
Listen up! The time has come for us
to display our honor

00:10:59.033 --> 00:11:01.494
as proud knights
of the kingdom of Meta-llicana!

00:11:01.577 --> 00:11:04.205
For Princess Sheila!

00:11:05.498 --> 00:11:07.166
-Attack!
-Okay.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:11.170
Hey, Sheila!

00:11:11.253 --> 00:11:14.423
We should get going while your knights
are buying some time for us.

00:11:14.507 --> 00:11:15.841
You go up first.

00:11:15.925 --> 00:11:16.759
Huh?

00:11:17.301 --> 00:11:18.594
Wait. But…

00:11:19.679 --> 00:11:22.473
That way I can slide down
and fight that thing if I need to.

00:11:22.556 --> 00:11:24.392
That… that's not the…

00:11:24.475 --> 00:11:26.727
I'll be watching.

00:11:26.811 --> 00:11:28.354
Don't worry.

00:11:28.437 --> 00:11:29.689
-Pervert!
-Uh…

00:11:32.316 --> 00:11:34.985
Well, I hope you got that
out of your system.

00:11:35.069 --> 00:11:37.029
You're gonna pay for that later.

00:11:39.865 --> 00:11:41.283
No more slowing me down.

00:11:41.367 --> 00:11:44.870
Let me go! Unhand me this instant!

00:11:45.996 --> 00:11:47.623
I'm in a bit of a hurry.

00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:49.583
You better hold on to me tight.

00:11:52.002 --> 00:11:55.756
<i>I-I-I can't believe</i>
<i>this is happening right now!</i>

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:00.386
<i>Come on, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:12:00.469 --> 00:12:02.304
<i>Better get here quickly.</i>

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:05.391
<i>Time's running out.</i>

00:12:08.102 --> 00:12:11.230
<i>Lucien. Dark Schneider!</i>

00:12:14.358 --> 00:12:17.486
<i>Wait a minute.</i>
<i>Did I hear him say he was in a hurry?</i>

00:12:26.996 --> 00:12:29.206
A knight never runs away!

00:12:29.290 --> 00:12:30.791
Stand your ground!

00:12:30.875 --> 00:12:33.669
Show this monster the courage of a knight!

00:12:33.753 --> 00:12:36.380
Wow. They're fighting
for you pretty hard down there.

00:12:38.841 --> 00:12:40.259
Hold still, would you?

00:12:40.342 --> 00:12:43.053
I… I'll try to.

00:12:51.812 --> 00:12:53.355
Huh? That's weird.

00:12:53.439 --> 00:12:57.985
D-Dark Schneider, please.
Can you put me down now?

00:12:59.111 --> 00:13:00.029
Huh?

00:13:00.529 --> 00:13:01.530
What?

00:13:03.574 --> 00:13:05.326
What… what is that thing?

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:09.330
It's name is Suzuki-Dogezaemon.

00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:10.998
Great.

00:13:11.081 --> 00:13:12.500
The passage between the dimensions

00:13:12.583 --> 00:13:15.419
must have opened up
when Anthrasax was activated.

00:13:15.503 --> 00:13:18.881
And it cause Dogezaemon
to materialize on our side.

00:13:22.343 --> 00:13:24.804
How dare you do this to me!

00:13:24.887 --> 00:13:27.765
Your wizard's going
to get here any minute now.

00:13:27.848 --> 00:13:30.309
But it'll be hard
to see us fight from down there.

00:13:30.392 --> 00:13:32.728
How about I bring you up so you can watch?

00:13:32.812 --> 00:13:35.314
No! Stay the hell away from me!

00:13:35.397 --> 00:13:38.692
<i>I'm not gonna let this guy</i>
<i>parade my naked body around!</i>

00:13:38.776 --> 00:13:41.779
If you try anything weird,
I'll bite your tongue off.

00:13:41.862 --> 00:13:43.155
I just thought of something.

00:13:43.239 --> 00:13:45.407
He may be trying to conquer the world,

00:13:45.491 --> 00:13:47.743
but that doesn't mean
he wants me to join him.

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:50.538
This is Dark Schneider
we're talking about.

00:13:50.621 --> 00:13:53.499
He does whatever he wants,
no matter what anyone says.

00:13:54.083 --> 00:13:55.918
Hey. Wait a minute.

00:13:56.001 --> 00:13:58.838
You claimed you were friends.
You're gonna fight him?

00:13:58.921 --> 00:14:02.049
I was his disciple
16 years ago,

00:14:02.132 --> 00:14:03.926
but things are much different now.

00:14:04.009 --> 00:14:07.179
In order to make sure Dark Schneider
and I can work together,

00:14:07.263 --> 00:14:09.056
we must know who's stronger.

00:14:09.139 --> 00:14:10.349
Damned!

00:14:11.100 --> 00:14:14.353
What the hell
is up with that thing's defenses?

00:14:14.436 --> 00:14:16.480
This spell
isn't anywhere near strong enough

00:14:16.564 --> 00:14:18.190
to break through it's barrier.

00:14:18.274 --> 00:14:21.777
<i>Back when he fought</i>
<i>the Great Priest, he seemed so confident,</i>

00:14:22.695 --> 00:14:25.406
<i>but at the moment,</i>
<i>he looks a little unsure of himself.</i>

00:14:27.616 --> 00:14:29.243
<i>He has to do something.</i>

00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:30.870
<i>We have to save Yoko!</i>

00:14:32.121 --> 00:14:34.164
Bullets of light!

00:14:34.248 --> 00:14:36.292
Kill that eyeball bastard!

00:14:36.375 --> 00:14:38.002
Anthem!

00:14:40.296 --> 00:14:43.757
What? The magic missiles
didn't hit their target!

00:14:43.841 --> 00:14:46.218
But how? Could I have messed up the spell?

00:14:46.302 --> 00:14:48.345
Son of a bitch!

00:14:54.518 --> 00:14:56.103
Dark Schneider!

00:14:59.690 --> 00:15:00.608
Shit!

00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:03.527
I can't let… let Dogezaemon beat me!

00:15:10.701 --> 00:15:12.244
His barrier's down!

00:15:12.328 --> 00:15:14.163
Nice work.

00:15:14.788 --> 00:15:19.168
Suki, sula, sushu, mega, megadae.

00:15:19.251 --> 00:15:20.794
Now, die!

00:15:21.587 --> 00:15:22.671
Sodom!

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.557
Well, if you want something done right…

00:15:33.641 --> 00:15:35.225
Yeah. You did okay.

00:15:35.309 --> 00:15:37.144
Oh no. You're wounded.

00:15:37.645 --> 00:15:39.355
You know, I'm actually a little relieved.

00:15:39.438 --> 00:15:41.523
Show's you're human, kinda.

00:15:42.191 --> 00:15:43.817
You're really worried about her,

00:15:43.901 --> 00:15:46.695
but you're far too embarrassed
to tell anyone, aren't you?

00:15:46.779 --> 00:15:49.323
I mean, that explains
why you've been acting so agitated

00:15:49.406 --> 00:15:50.574
ever since we left the castle.

00:15:50.658 --> 00:15:52.242
Yeah. That's not true.

00:15:55.788 --> 00:15:57.456
Let's just get moving!

00:15:57.539 --> 00:15:59.875
Every time you try messing with my head,

00:15:59.959 --> 00:16:01.835
you're gonna have
to suffer the consequences.

00:16:01.919 --> 00:16:03.295
So, you better watch yourself.

00:16:03.379 --> 00:16:05.756
Huh? W-wait. What?

00:16:05.839 --> 00:16:07.466
Hey.

00:16:07.549 --> 00:16:10.511
Please stop! I can't take it!

00:16:12.513 --> 00:16:14.515
He's faltering!
Don't give up!

00:16:14.598 --> 00:16:16.016
Right! Yes, sir.

00:16:16.100 --> 00:16:18.644
Remember,
Princess Sheila is fighting too!

00:16:18.727 --> 00:16:21.480
Let's finish this
so we can aid her in battle!

00:16:26.235 --> 00:16:29.905
I was almost positive we were close
to getting out of this damn labyrinth.

00:16:29.989 --> 00:16:31.198
There's something's wrong here.

00:16:32.741 --> 00:16:34.243
<i>My poor body.</i>

00:16:34.326 --> 00:16:37.162
<i>There's no way I'm pure enough</i>
<i>for marriage anymore.</i>

00:16:41.834 --> 00:16:43.961
<i>After all the things</i>
<i>he did to my body.</i>

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:47.798
<i>But I had no choice. I had to save Yoko.</i>

00:16:48.590 --> 00:16:50.426
<i>It was the very least I could do for her</i>

00:16:50.509 --> 00:16:53.303
<i>after everything she's done</i>
<i>for the good of the kingdom.</i>

00:16:54.596 --> 00:16:57.850
<i>I wonder if he ever did this</i>
<i>to her as well.</i>

00:16:59.018 --> 00:17:01.812
What's with you?
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:17:02.438 --> 00:17:04.398
You horny, or what?

00:17:04.982 --> 00:17:08.986
I'll have you know
this is your fault, not mine.

00:17:12.072 --> 00:17:13.907
I'm gonna let you walk now.

00:17:13.991 --> 00:17:15.826
Don't slow me down, got it?

00:17:15.909 --> 00:17:18.579
I won't. Just let me go already.

00:17:18.662 --> 00:17:21.582
Use these slender legs of yours
to keep up with me.

00:17:30.382 --> 00:17:31.675
Mace!

00:17:37.222 --> 00:17:39.224
Are you all right? You seem a bit tired.

00:17:39.308 --> 00:17:43.479
Pretty sure I used a few too many
big spells on Dogezaemon earlier.

00:17:43.979 --> 00:17:45.647
Not that you'd know what it's like,

00:17:45.731 --> 00:17:49.985
but magic takes a lot of focus,
physical energy, and mental energy.

00:17:50.069 --> 00:17:53.030
So using a lot of it
takes a toll on one's body.

00:17:53.739 --> 00:17:55.324
I'm the only person in the whole world

00:17:55.407 --> 00:17:58.035
who can use
this many spells in the same day.

00:17:58.118 --> 00:17:59.703
No one else comes close.

00:17:59.787 --> 00:18:02.414
Anthem! Damned!

00:18:02.498 --> 00:18:04.416
Sodom! Damned!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.919
Anthem! Damned!

00:18:08.921 --> 00:18:12.299
It doesn't look like we'll have to break
through more walls any time soon,

00:18:12.382 --> 00:18:15.094
so I'm gonna save
the rest of my spells for later.

00:18:16.428 --> 00:18:19.807
I've only got a spell or two left to use
for when I fight Gara.

00:18:19.890 --> 00:18:22.559
It'll just barely be enough
to beat that asshole.

00:18:22.643 --> 00:18:23.727
Oh.

00:18:23.811 --> 00:18:26.855
So that means you're gonna have
to hold your own from now on.

00:18:26.939 --> 00:18:29.358
Well, I'll do my best.

00:18:30.567 --> 00:18:31.443
Uh…

00:18:32.736 --> 00:18:34.196
Wow. How convenient.

00:18:34.279 --> 00:18:35.489
There's a sword here.

00:18:36.323 --> 00:18:37.699
A what?

00:18:38.283 --> 00:18:39.868
Hey. Hold on!

00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:43.205
I… I can't control it!

00:18:51.380 --> 00:18:53.715
Don't you know a trap when you see it?

00:18:54.341 --> 00:18:56.510
That was a cursed sword you picked up.

00:18:56.593 --> 00:18:57.803
You're bleeding.

00:18:58.303 --> 00:19:02.015
You really need to learn
to be more suspicious.

00:19:02.099 --> 00:19:03.517
Shit.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:07.437
It seems like they lined the blade
with a really potent poison too.

00:19:07.521 --> 00:19:10.357
Oh no. But you'll be okay,
right, Dark Schneider?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.192
I shouldn't have picked up that sword.

00:19:12.276 --> 00:19:14.403
I… It won't happen again.

00:19:14.486 --> 00:19:16.488
Hey. Sheila.

00:19:16.572 --> 00:19:17.865
Yes?

00:19:18.448 --> 00:19:20.242
What is it? Tell me.

00:19:20.325 --> 00:19:22.161
What do you need me to do?

00:19:22.244 --> 00:19:24.079
I'll do anything to help.

00:19:32.588 --> 00:19:33.797
You gotta suck it.

00:19:34.882 --> 00:19:35.757
Huh?

00:19:37.801 --> 00:19:41.388
Hurry up.
You gotta suck out all the poison.

00:19:41.471 --> 00:19:42.931
<i>Su…</i>

00:19:50.355 --> 00:19:53.233
Stay back! Don't you move any closer!

00:19:54.526 --> 00:19:55.777
Tell me something.

00:19:56.278 --> 00:20:00.199
Why are you and the Dark Rebel Army
attempting to bring back Anthrasax?

00:20:00.282 --> 00:20:04.161
We're going to use her power
to destroy the current world order.

00:20:04.244 --> 00:20:06.747
What easier way to accomplish that?

00:20:07.247 --> 00:20:09.499
Then we're going to build a new kingdom.

00:20:09.583 --> 00:20:11.835
A place where we're the ones in control.

00:20:13.462 --> 00:20:17.216
But Anthrasax is gonna destroy
the human race as we know it!

00:20:17.299 --> 00:20:20.594
There's not gonna be anything left
for you goons to rule over!

00:20:20.677 --> 00:20:21.887
Hmm.

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:25.807
What if I told you that we know of a way
to completely control her,

00:20:26.391 --> 00:20:29.937
and we could choose to spare
only the people who obey us.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:30.854
What?

00:20:32.397 --> 00:20:33.899
Not too much longer.

00:20:33.982 --> 00:20:37.694
I think Dark Schneider should be done
with the labyrinth right about now.

00:20:40.781 --> 00:20:43.325
The last obstacle
in his way is a tough one.

00:20:43.825 --> 00:20:45.327
<i>Do you have enough magic left</i>

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:49.623
<i>to defeat the demon god</i>
<i>that resides in the sword, Dark Schneider?</i>

00:20:49.706 --> 00:20:51.208
<i>I guess we'll see.</i>

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.922
<i>I have to use my mouth?</i>

00:20:57.005 --> 00:20:58.548
<i>I-I can't do it.</i>

00:21:02.427 --> 00:21:03.345
<i>But I…</i>

00:21:04.846 --> 00:21:07.349
<i>I'm the reason he's like this</i>
<i>in the first place,</i>

00:21:08.058 --> 00:21:09.685
<i>so I have to do it.</i>

00:21:13.897 --> 00:21:16.942
<i>I've got to hurry, or else he'll…</i>

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:37.796
<i>He's Tia Noto Yoko's wizard.</i>

00:21:40.299 --> 00:21:41.675
Harder.

00:21:41.758 --> 00:21:44.594
You gotta suck much harder!

00:21:49.725 --> 00:21:51.685
<i>Don't die!</i>

00:21:52.686 --> 00:21:54.313
<i>You can't die!</i>

00:22:00.193 --> 00:22:02.362
Are you the ones who disturb the sleep

00:22:02.446 --> 00:22:05.157
of the great demon god
who rests in the sword?

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:06.950
I demand that you answer me!

00:22:08.493 --> 00:22:09.703
That's Efreet!

00:22:09.786 --> 00:22:12.873
Out of all the things it could have been,
why did it have to be him?

00:22:13.373 --> 00:22:16.126
You will regret awakening me, humans.

00:22:16.209 --> 00:22:19.296
You shall both pay
for this transgression with your lives!
